5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! Let's make this place super clean! I want to know how other people do it. I'll check the visit to the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I agree, harmony is important. I'm a bit worried about the costs, so I'll look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're aiming for a solution that actually lasts, I'll handle the logistics. I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the ward complaint log for this point. Let's see what the real issues are.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'll keep things interesting! I want to see how the official side handles this, so I'll check the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the station block's meeting minutes. Let's see what's actually required!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we need a sustainable solution. To ensure fairness and accuracy, I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the statements at the residents' meeting.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,I wonder if the other neighborhoods have any secret tricks! I'm really excited to see how they handle their trash. Do you think the bin house has a cool design?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"That would be lovely, wouldn't it? A nice design might make the area feel more welcoming. I just hope we can find a balance between a beautiful setup and a cost that everyone can comfortably afford.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Design is a luxury, Midori. I'm more concerned with whether the trucks can actually access the spot without a fuss. If the logistics are a mess, no amount of ""welcoming"" aesthetics will stop the complaints.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Shunichi, you're such a killjoy! A little style never hurt anyone. But you're right about the fuss—I'm curious if the paperwork is just as tedious as the actual cleaning. Let's hope for some surprises!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Aesthetics and logistics are secondary to the actual distribution of the burden. We must ensure that the physical layout and the residents' expectations align with a truly equitable arrangement for all five households.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Equitable? That sounds like a big word, Asuka! I just want it to be a place where we can walk and smile, not hold our noses! I bet the other lanes have some really fun ideas!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I love your enthusiasm, Rin! A pleasant atmosphere makes a big difference. I just want to make sure that while we're dreaming up these great ideas, we're being mindful of everyone's financial situation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Financials and smiles are all well and good, but let's not forget we're dealing with trash. If we don't solve the root cause of the friction, we'll just be smiling while arguing over the bill.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"You're all so serious! Let's not turn this into a courtroom drama. I'm sure we can find a way to make it efficient and stylish without anyone losing their mind over the details. Right, Asuka?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Efficiency is important, but ignoring the details is how unfair arrangements are solidified. We cannot simply hope for the best; we need a concrete plan that accounts for the actual space and the history of the complaints.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be the one to bring the fun ideas! I can't wait to see what I find out. Let's all share our secrets in the next round and make the best plan ever!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone discovers. I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone happy and feels fair for every household. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's just hope the ""secrets"" we find are actually useful. I'll be interested to see if the data supports your optimism or my skepticism. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"Don't be such a grump, Shunichi! A little mystery makes the process more exciting. I'll be waiting to see if the official rules are as boring as you are. See you all soon!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be waiting for the results. Let us focus on the facts once we return, so we can avoid any vague agreements that might lead to further imbalances in the future.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
